        <item>
            <title>2.47.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:33:11 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>141</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.47.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- When your default Claude login is already at its 5-hour or weekly limit, new sessions now start on another login that still has quota. The pane shows which login it switched from and when that limit resets.

### Bug Fixes
- The same folder no longer appears twice in the recent directories list.
- The Settings window now remembers its size across launches.
]]></description>
