        <item>
            <title>2.46.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:38:13 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>139</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.46.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Remote session panes open much faster. The transcript sent from the other Mac is now far smaller: images from file reads load on demand as you scroll, large screenshots and pasted images are sent at a reduced size, and only the most recent 50 turns are sent. On one image-heavy session this cut the transfer from 6.4 MB to under 1 MB. Both Macs need this version for the full effect.
- The iPhone app's live view also receives smaller transcripts for the same reasons.
]]></description>
